/steam/apps/1844130/extras/2bdd156cc61fdedab50c0042395863da.webm?t=1743876345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>The central theme of the game, survival in cosmic unknowns, creates an immersive atmosphere. Players feel the weight of decisions, as each crisis resolved or failure suffered influences the trajectory of the story. The game mechanics are designed to encourage adaptability and creativity, offering a rich and renewable experience with each playthrough.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Breathtaking visuals and evocative illustrations (AI-generated) transport players to stunning stellar landscapes, reinforcing immersion in this futuristic universe. Meticulous details in the cards and game components contribute to creating a consistent and captivating aesthetic.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Stellar Orphans&quot;</strong> thus offers a comprehensive gaming experience, combining strategy, immersive storytelling, and polished visual components. Whether you are a fan of deck-building games or a science fiction enthusiast, this game promises a unique interstellar journey, where the survival of your crew depends on your choices and ingenuity in the mysterious depths of space. Are you ready to embark on this epic adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844130/extras/4be223176ebe9f923f7d4c955d2cc774.poster.avif?t=1743876345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844130/extras/4be223176ebe9f923f7d4c955d2cc774.webm?t=1743876345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844130/extras/4be223176ebe9f923f7d4c955d2cc774.mp4?t=1743876345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
